category: Database
build-depends: cygport gettext-devel libdbi-devel libexpat-devel libiconv-devel libreadline-devel
sdesc: "Reference database and bibliography tool"
ldesc: "RefDB is a reference database and bibliography tool for SGML, XML, and LaTeX
documents, sort of a Reference Manager or BibTeX for markup languages. It is
portable and known to run on Linux, Free/NetBSD, OSX, Solaris, and
Windows/Cygwin."
skip:

homepage: https://sourceforge.net/projects/refdb/
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
